{"title":"What should I ask Gaurav Kapadia?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/925596680/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Gaurav-Kapadia.html","date":1759260182000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  He is a tried and true New Yorker like few others, a very successful investor, an art collector, and he is on the board of the Whitney Museum.  And more.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=gaurav+kapadia&amp;sca_esv=f3826a3017f5c801&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=xS3caOaqGrCf5NoP4JL1kAg&amp;iflsig=AOw8s4IAAAAAaNw71XYxoUzpNNP5yJOTO1h1NHugPCn6&amp;ved=0ahUKEwimoafLmoGQAxWwD1kFHWBJHYIQ4dUDCBo&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=gaurav+kapadia&amp;gs_lp=Egdnd3Mtd2l6Ig5nYXVyYXYga2FwYWRpYTIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABDIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABDIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABDIFEAAYgARI_&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">Google on Gaurav Kapadia</a>.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/what-should-i-ask-gaurav-kapadia.html\">What should I ask Gaurav Kapadia?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/925596680/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/925596680/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/925596680/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/925596680/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/925596680/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src